{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231460","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231460","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423146001:0":{"text":"오, 이게 누구야. 후긴!","source_cn":"嚯！是呼金小子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C3796CF63269F8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423146002:0":{"text":"조아 스승님! 여전히 그대로시군요!","source_cn":"祖娅老师！你还是和以前一样啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C40018CBBC42BB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423146003:0":{"text":"후긴, 많이 컸구만! 마을을 떠날 땐 풋내기였는데 말이야!","source_cn":"呼金，你可是变了好多啊！你离开村子那会儿可还是个毛头小子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x849612DA8B324AF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423146004:0":{"text":"마을 일이 그렇게 커졌나? 너까지 돌아오게 만들 정도면...","source_cn":"村里的事都大到惊动你出山了吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CAA2250DCFB1194","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423146005:0":{"text":"내가 당분간 마을 대표를 맡게 됐거든. 이 난장판을 수습할 때까진 말이야.","source_cn":"我得暂时当一段时间村里的负责人了，起码得把这个局面收拾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02D85E996FC5EE89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423146006:0":{"text":"갑자기 마을에는 왜 돌아온 거야? 설마 이 노인네가 보고싶었던 건 아닐테고!","source_cn":"你怎么突然想起回村的？总不会是因为想我这个老人家吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61F5A3FF7DC9CA03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423146007:0":{"text":"마을에 큰일이 났다는 소문을 듣고 돌아왔는데...","source_cn":"我这次也是听说村子出了事，专程回来的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7014BFCFC28CC373","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423146008:0":{"text":"아, 조아 스승님! 이쪽은 아이언 헤드, 샤프 휘슬, 로우 그라운드입니다. 자자, 조아 스승님이랑 인사하라고!","source_cn":"对了，祖娅老师！这是铁头，这是尖哨，这是矮地……来，跟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AAD0A314C62C4B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:10:1423146009:0":{"text":"오래간만에 만난 조아와 후긴은 이야기꽃을 피웠다.\n잠시 스승과 제자가 오붓한 대화를 나누게 해주자.","source_cn":"呼金和祖娅滔滔不绝地叙起了旧……\\n让他们师徒单独相处...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x227EF3361630723D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"후긴","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":3}}